   5:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_aes.c ****   * @version V1.8.0
   6:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_aes.c ****   * @date    04-November-2016
   7:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_aes.c ****   * @brief   This file provides high level functions to encrypt and decrypt an 
   8:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_aes.c ****   *          input message using AES in ECB/CBC/CTR/GCM/CCM modes.
   9:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_aes.c ****   *          It uses the stm32f4xx_cryp.c/.h drivers to access the STM32F4xx CRYP
  10:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_aes.c ****   *          peripheral.
  11:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_aes.c ****   *          AES-ECB/CBC/CTR/GCM/CCM modes are available on STM32F437x Devices.
  12:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_aes.c ****   *          For STM32F41xx Devices, only AES-ECB/CBC/CTR modes are available.
  13:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_aes.c ****   *
  14:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_aes.c **** @verbatim
  15:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_aes.c ****  ===================================================================
  16:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_aes.c ****                   ##### How to use this driver #####
  17:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_aes.c ****  ===================================================================
  18:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_aes.c ****  [..]
  19:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_aes.c ****    (#) Enable The CRYP controller clock using 
  20:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_aes.c ****       RCC_AHB2PeriphClockCmd(RCC_AHB2Periph_CRYP, ENABLE); function.
  21:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_aes.c ****   
  22:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_aes.c ****    (#) Encrypt and decrypt using AES in ECB Mode using CRYP_AES_ECB() function.
  23:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_aes.c ****   
  24:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_aes.c ****    (#) Encrypt and decrypt using AES in CBC Mode using CRYP_AES_CBC() function.
  25:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_aes.c ****   
  26:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_aes.c ****    (#) Encrypt and decrypt using AES in CTR Mode using CRYP_AES_CTR() function.
  27:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_aes.c **** 
  28:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_aes.c ****    (#) Encrypt and decrypt using AES in GCM Mode using CRYP_AES_GCM() function.
  29:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_aes.c ****    
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccLf3zK1.s 			page 2


