 665:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_aes.c ****   * @param  AuthTAG: pointer to the authentication TAG buffer.
 666:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_aes.c ****   * @retval An ErrorStatus enumeration value:
 667:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_aes.c ****   *          - SUCCESS: Operation done
